      "message": "I don\u0027t see any boot test failures on presubmit for PS2. I see:\n```\n  error (0)\n  warning (1)\n  info (2)\n  success (18)\n```\n\nThat sounds like a bug. In my mind if `ShouldDenyAccessToMember` with `kCheck` returns true then it should also return true with `kLinking`. I don\u0027t see how changing the access method from `kCheck` to `kLinking` would mean that it is now fine to access it. Is the policy being changed? Or maybe the access flags?\n\nIf you can repro maybe we can CHECK failure and log more info to understand what\u0027s going on.",
